on plus paired kill criteria as the shared operational metric across all three positions. The non-negotiable that distinguishes my final position is bifurcation-by-recoverability — calibrated triggers for the recoverable majority, pre-market gates retained for the irreversible minority, with the named fiduciary as the human in both loops. That is the safetyist position after this debate: proportional where the hazard is bounded, pre-committed where it is not.",
